.TH PIVOT_ROOT 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
pivot_root \- changes the root mount in the calling mount namespace; requires privileges and strict mount-point conditions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/mount.h>
.B int pivot_root(const char* new_root, const char* put_old);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Changes the root mount in the calling mount namespace; requires privileges and strict mount-point conditions.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pivot_root (2)
